            <note corresp="#d338-f3" n="28" xml:id="d338-f3-content">
                <p>A Firestone representative.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d338-f4" n="29" xml:id="d338-f4-content">
                <p>Reed Paige Clark, General Receiver of Customs and Financial Adviser to Liberia,
                    1911–1916, appointed Second Secretary of Legation at Monrovia, Feb. 4, 1926.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
